{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I:</b> It is written that HaShem visits the iniquity of the land upon it; therefore He decreed to annihilate them, for their statutes are for each man and his father to go after whoring. And He mentioned the Amorite, for he is stronger than the seven [nations], and likewise: \"for the iniquity of the Amorite is not yet full.\" Now Moses slew the two eastern kings of the Amorites, and Joshua said to give us into the hand of the western Amorite, and behold from him there is fear."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:49.037358964Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}